      "id": 11745,
      "name": "bshugg",
      "username": "bshugg",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-12-26T04:33:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Played 4 games over the holiday with losses to Promo Omni, Dreamer, Matriarch and a win versus La Capitain. &nbsp; What never seems to stop amazing me is how darn close the games often are despite being a giant pile of randomness. &nbsp; &nbsp;For example both dreamer and Omni came down to the LAST turn, last card situations where it would of gone either way. &nbsp; We had the kill on the table when the villian drew the exact card needed to win. &nbsp;Those are the games you remember and enjoy for a long time no matter how they end up.</p><p>Also on a happy side note with the arrival of my Super Sci Tachyon I now own every single promo and deck released until my cosmos preorder arrives. &nbsp;Thanks all that hooked me up!</p>",
